VAL_ 1879 CVC_CompOffCode 0 "The compressor is normal" 1 "Compressor suction pressure protection to turned off" 2 "Compressor discharge pressure protection to turned off" 4 "Compressor suction temperature protection to turned off" 8 "Compressor discharge temperature protection to turned off" 16 "Compressor evaporator temperature protection to turned off" 32 "EXV1 initialization is not complete and the compressor is turned of" 64 "EXV2 initialization is not complete and the compressor is turned of" 128 "W5WV1 initialization is not complete and the compressor is turned of" 256 "W5WV2 initialization is not complete and the compressor is turned of" 512 "The cooling fan is faulty and the compressor to turned of" 1024 "The compressor is confirmed to be faulty, and the compressor to turned of" 2048 "The system mode need the compressor to be turned off" 4096 "Inlet water temperature is too low cause compressor to turn off" 8192 "Cabin has no cooling and heating demand, and the compressor is turned off" 16384 "Water pump 1 fails cause the compressor to turned off" 32768 "Water pump 2 fails cause the compressor to turned off" 65536 "The blower fails or stop, the compressor shuts down" 131072 "CVC battery voltage is too low cause the compressor to turned off" 262144 "CVC battery voltage is too high cause the compressor to turned off" 524288 "KL15 is OFF, compressor off" 1048576 "Compressor discharge PT sensor fault cause compressor to turn down" 2097152 "Compressor suction PT sensor failure cause compressor to turn down" 4194304 "ACC outlet PT sensor fault, compressor shutdown" 8388608 "Compressor detection communication failure, compressor shut down" 16777216 "CVC detected a communication fault with the compressor and shut it down" 33554432 "EXV1 turned too small, compressor protection turned off" 67108864 "EXV2 turned too small, compressor protection turned off" ;
